        "questionAudio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/rabbit-picnic-question.m4a"
      },
      "pages": [
        {
          "art": 5,
          "en": {
            "text": "Rabbit packed two apples for a picnic. He found a shady tree and sat down.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/rabbit-picnic-1.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "खरगोश पिकनिक के लिए दो सेब लाया। वह एक छायादार पेड़ के नीचे बैठ गया।",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/rabbit-picnic-1.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 6,
          "en": {
            "text": "Bear came to sit beside him. “I forgot my snack,” said Bear.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/rabbit-picnic-2.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "भालू उसके पास आकर बैठा। भालू बोला, “मैं अपना नाश्ता लाना भूल गया।”",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/rabbit-picnic-2.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 5,
          "en": {
            "text": "“Here is an apple for you!” said Rabbit. Bear smiled and said, “Thank you!”",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/rabbit-picnic-3.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "खरगोश बोला, “यह सेब तुम्हारे लिए!” भालू मुस्कुराया और बोला, “धन्यवाद!”",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/rabbit-picnic-3.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 6,
          "en": {
            "text": "They ate their apples together. A picnic was even nicer with a friend.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/rabbit-picnic-4.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "दोनों ने साथ बैठकर सेब खाए। दोस्त के साथ पिकनिक का मज़ा और बढ़ गया।",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/rabbit-picnic-4.m4a"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
