        "questionAudio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/elephant-friend-question.m4a"
      },
      "pages": [
        {
          "art": 8,
          "en": {
            "text": "Monkey wanted to cross a little puddle. He did not want to get his feet wet.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/elephant-friend-1.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "बंदर पानी के एक छोटे गड्ढे को पार करना चाहता था। वह अपने पैर गीले नहीं करना चाहता था।",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/elephant-friend-1.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 0,
          "en": {
            "text": "Elephant saw his friend waiting. “Let us find a dry way,” he said.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/elephant-friend-2.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "हाथी ने अपने दोस्त को खड़े देखा। वह बोला, “चलो, कोई सूखा रास्ता ढूँढ़ते हैं।”",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/elephant-friend-2.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 8,
          "en": {
            "text": "They walked around the puddle, side by side. Monkey’s feet stayed dry.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/elephant-friend-3.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "दोनों साथ-साथ गड्ढे के किनारे से घूमकर निकल गए। बंदर के पैर सूखे रहे।",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/elephant-friend-3.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 0,
          "en": {
            "text": "“Thank you for walking with me!” said Monkey. The two friends smiled.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/elephant-friend-4.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "बंदर बोला, “मेरे साथ चलने के लिए धन्यवाद!” दोनों दोस्त मुस्कुराने लगे।",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/elephant-friend-4.m4a"
          }
        }
      ]
