        "questionAudio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/cat-bedtime-question.m4a"
      },
      "pages": [
        {
          "art": 4,
          "en": {
            "text": "Cat had a lovely day of playing. Now the sky was dark and the moon was bright.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/cat-bedtime-1.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "बिल्ली ने दिन भर खूब खेला। अब आसमान में अँधेरा था और चाँद चमक रहा था।",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/cat-bedtime-1.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 4,
          "en": {
            "text": "She put her toys in a basket. Then she brushed her teeth.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/cat-bedtime-2.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "उसने अपने खिलौने टोकरी में रखे। फिर उसने अपने दाँत साफ़ किए।",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/cat-bedtime-2.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 4,
          "en": {
            "text": "Cat snuggled under her soft blanket. “Goodnight, Moon,” she whispered.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/cat-bedtime-3.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "बिल्ली अपनी मुलायम चादर ओढ़कर लेट गई। उसने धीरे से कहा, “शुभ रात्रि, चाँद।”",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/cat-bedtime-3.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "art": 4,
          "en": {
            "text": "She closed her eyes and took a slow breath. Cat was ready for a cozy sleep.",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/en/stories/cat-bedtime-4.m4a"
          },
          "hi": {
            "text": "उसने आँखें बंद कीं और धीरे से साँस ली। बिल्ली अब आराम से सोने के लिए तैयार थी।",
            "audio": "/assets/audio/hi/stories/cat-bedtime-4.m4a"
          }
        }
      ]
